======================================================================
  Architecture Diagram: Phase 96 - Disaster Recovery: RPO & RTO
======================================================================

1. Simplest Baseline Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Backing up database once per week with no recovery plan (RPO = 7 days).

   [Client] ──▶ [Application Server] ──▶ [Primary Datastore]


2. Scaled / Resilient Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Continuous WAL archiving and point-in-time recovery (RPO < 5 mins, RTO < 30 mins).

                               ┌──▶ [Worker Node A] ──┬──▶ [Cache]
[Client] ──▶ [Load Balancer] ──┼──▶ [Worker Node B] ──┤
                               └──▶ [Worker Node C] ──┴──▶ [Primary DB] ──▶ [Replicas]
                                         │
                                         ▼
                                   [Event Queue] ──▶ [Async Workers]

======================================================================
